{{Quote|How do you imagine we came to the point where we have so much, while so many outside the gates of this elegant home have to struggle to survive?|Wilhuff Tarkin's father, to his son|<ref name="Trkn" />}}
The [[Tarkin family]] of [[Eriadu]] lived in a elegant and luxurious '''family compound'''. Like other mansions inhabited by wealthy Eriaduans, it clumsily emulated the architectural style of the [[Core Worlds]]. When [[Wilhuff Tarkin]] was still a [[Gender|boy]], he lived in the family compound with his [[Wilhuff Tarkin's father|father]] and [[Wilhuff Tarkin's mother|mother]].<ref name="Trkn" />

